"text":"The heavy–light decomposition of a rooted tree or arborescence: each vertex’s heavy child is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its child with the largest subtree (the first in "},{"code":"children(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order on a tie), and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"heavy edges form paths. Vertices get positions in a preorder that takes the heavy child first,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so each heavy path and each subtree is an interval of positions, and any path between two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices is at most 2⌊log₂ n⌋ + 1 intervals ("},{"code":"segments(from:to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), for path and subtree"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries over a structure indexed by position."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/documentation\/TreeAlgorithms\/HeavyLightDecomposition","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/treealgorithms\/heavylightdecomposition","kind":"symbol","title":"HeavyLightDecomposition"},"doc://TreeAlgorithms/documentation/TreeAlgorithms/HeavyLightDecomposition/Preorder-swift.struct":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Preorder"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Preorder"}],"title":"HeavyLightDecomposition.Preorder","identifier":"doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/documentation\/TreeAlgorithms\/HeavyLightDecomposition\/Preorder-swift.struct","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/treealgorithms\/heavylightdecomposition\/preorder-swift.struct","abstract":[{"text":"The vertices by position.","type":"text"}],"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"